            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lazyme"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Yum. I've always loved coffee nudges but haven't had one for a very long time. This was great and thanks for sharing it.",
            "datePublished": "2019-09-28T20:01:01.587Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dimples22"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A friend from Oregon introduced me to this yummy cold-weather drink several years ago. Aside from calories, I have begun to being anxious while waiting for cold weather arrived. This will definitely replace the hot toddy we would fix when camping many years ago. THANK YOU for posting this. I had forgotten about the Coffee Nudge!. DELICIOUS!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!",
            "datePublished": "2017-12-21T04:40:34.890Z"
          },
          {
