            },
            "reviewBody": "So good. Great drink on a cold day",
            "datePublished": "2016-10-21T18:02:51.717Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tracy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "One of my favorites, but it isn't original. This is a classic called a \"Keoke coffee\", which I've ordered in bars/restaurants many times. It's a bit of an uncommon recipe, so many bartenders don't know it. Still, I've always liked it better than the more common coffee/liqueur drinks you usually see. Fond memories of sipping one of these on a snowy weekend afternoon in Alaska... Mmmmm...",
            "datePublished": "2010-04-24T07:38:09.923Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
